  {
   "id": "raccoin-coin-pusher-roguelike-360748@major-2026-06-25",
   "gameId": "raccoin-coin-pusher-roguelike-360748",
   "displayName": "New Cabinet Update!✨",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-25T17:23:47.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Pawshers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been a while! We hope you've been doing well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "NEW CABINET!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're excited to share that we've just released a new content update for RACCOIN! Alongside the Cardboard Cabinet, our raccoon boss Robin has now built a brand-new Arcade Mode cabinet: the Classic Cabinet!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45739858/ff2694382645a091635701318fac5759563af78d.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Class Cabinet currently features two arcade mini games: Whac-A-Mole and Raccoon Quest.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In both games, you have one simple mission: push the coin! No complicated mechanics. No brain-melting strategies. Just pure coin-pushing satisfaction. You also unlock a new cabinet skin “Hawaii”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "On top of that, we've also introduced the Lab Cabinet!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Lab Cabinet is your personal playground for experimenting with strategies, testing builds, and discovering powerful new combos. Try out wild ideas, push your setups to the limit, and see what works best before taking them into a real run. You will also unlock “Lab” cabinet skin with it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45739858/ed4b48187d1dfc8fff25f414f7ba5ce1bdbb810e.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Just be careful not to burn down the lab!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Cluckmech Oasis Collab",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We had a collaboration with Cluckmech Oasis! You’’ll find Cluckmech Oasis themed cabinet skin and coin skin in this collab!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45739858/7193f91cd7afd7137ede3359938c0cf957e83aeb.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To celebrate the collaboration, we also launched a bundle with them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/77130/RACCOIN__Cluckmech_Oasis/?beta=1\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balance",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The chip \"Bank\" is no longer exclusive to the Manager and is now available to all characters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tag for Fridgeion has been changed from Food to Chaos.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The \"Run Data\" screen now shows each character’s preferred coins.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved controller experience in the character selection screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved lighting and clipping issues for some cabinet skins.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where the right-side chute was misaligned.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "RACCOIN is Coming to Consoles!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're also thrilled to announce that RACCOIN is heading to consoles later this year!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game is currently planned for Nintendo Switch 2, PlayStation 5, and Xbox X|S. More raccoons. More coins. More fun. Stay tuned for more details!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "SUMMER SALE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Grab your copy before the sale ends, and start pushing some coins today.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3784030/RACCOIN_Coin_Pusher_Roguelike/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
