       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the game could not launch properly (showing a Unity error popup) on Windows 10 versions earlier than 19043.: (Thanks to the players who helped with testing! If you’re still unable to launch the game, please let us know.): Balance Changes",
